('nr-1810037065-5dc223f28b6a','naver-1810037065','naver','I love this cafe. After spending some time in the busy Myeongdong food street, it is a quiet place where you can sit, relax, and have a nice beverage and cake. I also like its colkection of souvenirs and cups, though these ate a bit on the pricey side','2026-10-05T00:00:00.000Z'),
