('nr-11672555-2d81f174b4b3','naver-11672555','naver','Cheongpyeong Galbi is a great spot for spicy braised short ribs! The tender beef, rice cakes, and vegetables simmer in a rich, spicy broth that pairs perfectly with rice. Adding udon noodles makes it even better as they soak up all that delicious flavor. Fried eggs and assorted vegetable side dishes round out the meal nicely. You can choose mild, medium, or spicy to suit your taste.','2026-11-03T00:00:00.000Z'),
