('nr-1392481658-5e83de80c910','naver-1392481658','naver','A hidden gem, specializing in Korean barbecue, located near at Apgujung and Sinsa station. It is especially known for its exceptionally fresh, high-quality cuts of meat that are rich in flavor. Combined with generous portions, delicious side dishes, and friendly service by Ms. SS Lee, it delivers an authentic Korean barbecue experience at a reasonable price. free valet parking and ice cream good!!','2026-10-24T00:00:00.000Z'),
