('nr-38642629-b968ce585a57','naver-38642629','naver','Great spot in Seoul. The bartender from Hong Kong assisted us the whole way through and recommended both classic & exotic drinks ranging from spicy tequila and a gin-based Westminster. All the drinks tasted incredible, quick to serve, and the free peanuts and chocolates were excellent. The buffet was simple but high quality, and the friendly English service made the visit memorable.','2026-07-31T00:00:00.000Z'),
('nr-38642629-3cca90d9a079','naver-38642629','naver','생일기념으로 찾은 클라우드 루프탑. 노을뷰가 역시나 멋진곳이네요. 화이트 와인부터 시작해 레드와인에. 하이볼까지 두시간 동안 다양하게 잘 즐기다 왔어요. 특별한날 기념하고 싶을때. 오면 기억에 남을것 같아요.','2026-07-29T00:00:00.000Z'),
